<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 28/29.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 28/29.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 29. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   29.07.97	  28.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6194	    6.6508</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1698	    2.1785</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.2930	    4.3108</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4089	    3.4420</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5059	    0.5047</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7333	    0.7369</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2712	    0.2723</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8699	    6.8942</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6895	    0.6894</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1581	    1.1643</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
